h1 Derped 2025
  p
    ' Share
    = link "this link", to: ~p"/profiles/#{@user}/derped?token=#{@token}"
  h2 Global Statistics
    h3 Users
    p
      ' A total of
      = @global_new_user_count
      | new users were created this year.
    h3 Images
    p
      ' A total of
      span.stat>
        = number_with_delimiter(@global_new_image_count)
      | new images were uploaded this year.
    h3 Comments
    p
      ' A total of
      span.stat>
        = number_with_delimiter(@global_new_comment_count)
      | new comments were posted this year.
    h3 Topics
    p
      ' A total of
      span.stat>
        = number_with_delimiter(@global_new_topic_count)
      | new topics were created this year.
    h3 Posts
    p
      ' A total of
      span.stat>
        = number_with_delimiter(@global_new_post_count)
      | new posts were created this year.
    h3 Image Faves
    p
      ' A total of
      span.stat>
        = number_with_delimiter(@global_new_image_fave_count)
      | new image faves were added this year.
    h3 Image Votes
    p
      ' A total of
      span.stat>
        = number_with_delimiter(@global_new_image_vote_count)
      | new image votes were cast this year.
    h3 Tag Changes
    p
      ' A total of
      span.stat>
        = number_with_delimiter(@global_new_tag_change_count)
      | new tag changes were made this year.
    h3 Source Changes
    p
      ' A total of
      span.stat>
        = number_with_delimiter(@global_new_source_change_count)
      | new source changes were made this year.